WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.984 --> 00:00:03.341
Hello, I'm Conan O'Brien.

00:00:03.341 --> 00:00:04.504
Over the past year, I've been

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:06.701
taking my show around the world.

00:00:06.701 --> 00:00:08.979
I was trying to figure
out where to go next

00:00:08.979 --> 00:00:10.701
when I got an assist from our good friend,

00:00:10.701 --> 00:00:13.459
the German comedian actor and star

00:00:13.459 --> 00:00:16.103
of Pitch Perfect 2, Flula Borg.

00:00:16.103 --> 00:00:17.580
I would very much like to go to Germany.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:19.682
Maybe I could come to Germany with you.

00:00:19.682 --> 00:00:21.303
I will join you and you will join me.

00:00:21.303 --> 00:00:23.202
We would be like a three-legged sack race

00:00:23.202 --> 00:00:25.236
but with no sack and it's not a race.

00:00:25.236 --> 00:00:26.380
We will take our time.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.079
(audience laughs)

00:00:29.079 --> 00:00:32.912
(orchestral music crescendos)

00:00:48.741 --> 00:00:50.991
(cheering)

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:00.531
Hi, oh wait no.

00:01:00.531 --> 00:01:02.190
You don't have to...

00:01:02.190 --> 00:01:04.451
You can come over now.

00:01:04.451 --> 00:01:06.254
You're allowed.

00:01:06.254 --> 00:01:07.171
Since 1989.

00:01:08.451 --> 00:01:10.856
You're allowed to come over, it's okay.

00:01:10.856 --> 00:01:13.106
You can be with your lover.

00:01:18.696 --> 00:01:19.752
(audience laughs)

00:01:19.752 --> 00:01:22.429
I need something that
says I am Berlin guy.

00:01:22.429 --> 00:01:23.429
What's that?

00:01:23.429 --> 00:01:27.119
This is a former east German medal.

00:01:27.119 --> 00:01:28.584
Okay.

00:01:28.584 --> 00:01:29.417
Thanks.

00:01:31.635 --> 00:01:32.648
You gonna kiss me?

00:01:32.648 --> 00:01:33.481
Yes.

00:01:36.792 --> 00:01:38.590
You're a really crazy big man.

00:01:38.590 --> 00:01:41.246
Crazy big man, that
is my name in Germany.

00:01:41.246 --> 00:01:43.785
Are you the guy from
the late night show?

00:01:43.785 --> 00:01:45.145
Yes I am, yes.

00:01:45.145 --> 00:01:46.745
Letterman or?

00:01:46.745 --> 00:01:47.840
Yes Letterman.

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:49.507
I'm David Letterman.

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:52.324
(audience laughs)

00:01:52.324 --> 00:01:54.164
Would you like this?

00:01:54.164 --> 00:01:55.268
No, thank you.

00:01:55.268 --> 00:01:58.101
(audience laughs)

00:01:59.748 --> 00:02:01.200
So I must have this.

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:04.000
This is a vice for sexual pleasure.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:05.625
This is an Amish sex toy.

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:06.628
How much is this?

00:02:06.628 --> 00:02:07.741
(speaks foreign language)

00:02:07.741 --> 00:02:08.744
[Woman] 30!

00:02:08.744 --> 00:02:10.883
You know for the whole deer I'd pay 30.

00:02:10.883 --> 00:02:12.243
21?

00:02:12.243 --> 00:02:13.171
22 okay.

00:02:13.171 --> 00:02:14.350
Yes!

00:02:14.350 --> 00:02:16.072
Would you hold my vice please?

00:02:16.072 --> 00:02:18.552
Hold my vice, would you hold my cane?

00:02:18.552 --> 00:02:20.378
Stay right here, don't you,

00:02:20.378 --> 00:02:21.601
I know what you're trying to do.

00:02:21.601 --> 00:02:22.691
(audience laughs)

00:02:22.691 --> 00:02:23.971
Well, I'll call the police.

00:02:23.971 --> 00:02:26.345
I'll call the vice squad.

00:02:26.345 --> 00:02:27.785
That's a pun back in America.

00:02:27.785 --> 00:02:29.993
(audience laughs)

00:02:29.993 --> 00:02:31.390
Danke.

00:02:31.390 --> 00:02:32.355
How much?

00:02:32.355 --> 00:02:33.431
(audience laughs)

00:02:33.431 --> 00:02:35.470
I must have this, how much?

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:37.331
No it's not the same guy is it?

00:02:37.331 --> 00:02:40.649
He screwed me on the price of
a deer giving me the finger.

00:02:40.649 --> 00:02:43.571
(audience laughs)

00:02:43.571 --> 00:02:44.586
What?

00:02:44.586 --> 00:02:45.849
(audience laughs)

00:02:45.849 --> 00:02:46.682
Kaput, ah!

00:02:49.269 --> 00:02:50.867
(audience laughs)

00:02:50.867 --> 00:02:52.485
This is for men?

00:02:52.485 --> 00:02:55.070
Do I need to give you my size,
or is it one size fits all?

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:58.025
Yes what size do you have?

00:02:58.025 --> 00:03:01.107
Well, what are we talking about here?

00:03:01.107 --> 00:03:02.126
Stop laughing!

00:03:02.126 --> 00:03:04.121
(audience laughs)

00:03:04.121 --> 00:03:06.371
(cheering)

00:03:11.406 --> 00:03:13.891
Yes it's really me, settle down.

00:03:13.891 --> 00:03:15.507
I blew that kid's mind.

00:03:15.507 --> 00:03:19.674
Couldn't believe he saw
David Letterman in person.

